flowchart TD
    Start([Start Billing & Payment]) --> FetchUnbilled[Fetch Unbilled Charges Across Modules]
    FetchUnbilled --> ConsolidateBill[Compile Consultation, Lab, Pharmacy & IP Bed Charges]
    ConsolidateBill --> ApplyDiscount[Apply Authorized Discounts & Subsidies]
    ApplyDiscount --> CalculateTotal[Calculate Taxes & Net Payable Balance]
    CalculateTotal --> SelectPaymentMode[Select Payment Mode: Cash / Card / UPI]
    SelectPaymentMode --> ProcessPayment{Payment Approved?}
    ProcessPayment -- No --> DisplayDeclined[Display Payment Failed Alert & Re-try] --> SelectPaymentMode
    ProcessPayment -- Yes --> UpdateBillPaid[Update Bill Status = Paid]
    UpdateBillPaid --> GenerateReceipt[Generate & Print Official Itemized Receipt]
    GenerateReceipt --> End([End Billing])
